#showas:额外极限 2
Extremely difficult bonus scenario. Just you and one AI, which is set to the maximum difficulty of 10.

Map type is "realistic", with 80 planets, pretty much considered the default. The AI is only a Full Ensemble, nothing special.

Your starting fleets are all the default options.

This is identical to the Extreme 1 scenario, with one twist: There are no AI Progress reducers, except for Co-Processors and the Super Terminal.

Winning this would be pretty impressive! If you do, please report how you did it.